lysed once, applied to every lane; any width is lanes of a vec4, so the same search covers it\n  assuming c in [-0, 1] (each component; no NaN)\n  reference: IEEE binary32, round to nearest even; pow, exp2, log2 correctly rounded (long double, then f32); NaN payloads ignored, -0 and +0 distinct; GLSL's undefined results (pow of x < 0, log2 of x <= 0 ...) may become anything\n  float cost under gt1030 (each component counted; step = compare + select, mix = subtract + fma): 30 -> 21 (-30.0%)\n  sink unorm8: one step is 0.00392157.  The conversion clamps, scales and rounds; rounding to nearest (what Vulkan asks of it; it allows either neighbour), a value within one step of the reference's is stored as the same integer or the next.  The rewrites may move a stored value by that much in all, wherever the reference's is a number\n    budget 0.00392, the rewrites accepted use at most 0.00195 of it\n  rewrites, the largest savings first:\n    %49 = OpExtInst %v3float %2 Pow %48 %22\n      -> %ucas_f1t = OpFSub %v3float %48 %ucas_k3_3f060000_3f060000_3f060000\n         %ucas_f1h1 = OpExtInst %v3float %2 Fma %ucas_k3_3e7cd7a5_3e7cd7a5_3e7cd7a5 %ucas_f1t %ucas_k3_bd63a6b8_bd63a6b8_bd63a6b8\n         %ucas_f1h2 = OpExtInst %v3float %2 Fma %ucas_f1h1 %ucas_f1t %ucas_k3_3e963cf9_3e963cf9_3e963cf9\n         %ucas_f1h3 = OpExtInst %v3float %2 Fma %ucas_f1h2 %ucas_f1t %ucas_k3_3fa4994b_3fa4994b_3fa4994b\n         %ucas_f1h4 = OpExtInst %v3float %2 Fma %ucas_f1h3 %ucas_f1t %ucas_k3_3f78686a_3f78686a_3f78686a\n         %49 = OpExtInst %v3float %2 Fma %ucas_f1h4 %ucas_f1t %ucas_k3_3e58ce7b_3e58ce7b_3e58ce7b\n      (pow as a polynomial; -6)\n      proof: an approximation (derived bound)\n        relative minimax of q^2.4 on [0.052132703, 1] (remez.c), t = q - 0.5234375, coefficients rounded to f32, Horner with fma:\n          real error certified on 4096 geometric pieces (|E| <= |E(m)| + |E'(m)| h/2 + max|E''| h^2/8, E'' bounded by sum i(i-1)|a_i| T^(i-2) + |y(y-1)| q^(y-2)): 0.00118 rel